WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:04.460
For this quiz, I want you to
experience the web without images.

00:00:04.460 --> 00:00:06.180
Install Lynx and ChromeVox.

00:00:06.180 --> 00:00:08.170
You can find some links
in the instructor notes.

00:00:08.170 --> 00:00:10.700
Once you do,
visit an image heavy website.

00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:14.840
Ask yourself, what is it like
experiencing the web without images, and

00:00:14.840 --> 00:00:16.850
try listening to a site with ChromeVox.

00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:18.330
If all you had was ChromeVox,

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:21.350
could you figure out what
the images were trying to tell you?

00:00:21.350 --> 00:00:24.640
Making your website accessible to
everybody is incredibly important,

00:00:24.640 --> 00:00:26.730
because not only does it
make you a good person,

00:00:26.730 --> 00:00:30.010
it means that more people
can experience your website.

00:00:30.010 --> 00:00:31.600
So, when you check this
check box down here,

00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:34.870
it means that you are promising to
use all attributes responsibly.

